PN,30601
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said
OL,8,Frape, serious child sex offences, and
OL,9,Fgrooming are to be excluded from
OL,10,Fupcoming cuts to prison sentences.
OL,12,FIt comes after Burnham paused plans to
OL,13,Frelease prisoners early in September
OL,14,Fto ease overcrowding in jails.
OL,16,FThe scheme will now be delayed until
OL,17,FOctober.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FBurnham said he "wanted to go even
OL,8,Ffurther", but that it is not possible
OL,9,Fwithout the prison system collapsing
OL,10,Fand putting the public "at much
OL,11,Fgreater risk".
OL,13,FHowever, the widow of PC Andrew
OL,14,FHarper, who was killed in the line of
OL,15,Fduty in 2019, said she was "disgusted"
OL,16,Fthat her husband's killers had not
OL,17,Fbeen excluded from early release.
OL,26,@oD@QOUpD@HO]rD@XOUsD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FThe PM assured the public that
OL,8,Foffenders will face tighter community
OL,9,Fsupervision, including new GPS
OL,10,Fmonitoring for rapists to restrict
OL,11,Fmovements.
OL,13,F"Keeping the public safe is my top
OL,14,Fpriority. That's why I asked for an
OL,15,Furgent review of the prisoner release
OL,16,Fscheme, Burnham said. "I fully
OL,17,Funderstand the anger, anxiety and
OL,18,Fdistress that's been caused. I've
OL,19,Fheard that loud and clear.
OL,26,@uD@AOUxD@WOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,F"That's why we're making significant
OL,8,Fchanges: offenders who have been
OL,9,Fsentenced for rape, serious child sex
OL,10,Foffences and other grooming offences
OL,11,Fwill be excluded from the changes.
OL,13,F"I want to be honest ` I wanted to go
OL,14,Feven further as I know there will
OL,15,Fstill be concerns about other
OL,16,Foffenders having their sentence
OL,17,Fshortened.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,F"But it's not possible without the
OL,8,Fprison system reaching capacity and
OL,9,Fcollapsing, which would put public
OL,10,Fsafety at much greater risk. That's
OL,11,Fwhy we will also be introducing much
OL,12,Ftougher community measures.
OL,14,F"There will be a presumption that all
OL,15,Foffenders are tagged, longer periods
OL,16,Fof supervision and tough new rules,
OL,17,Fincluding restriction zones for
OL,18,Foffenders."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOUzD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FUnder changes in the Sentencing Act,
OL,8,Fsome 6,000 offenders were set to be
OL,9,Flet out of prison in September after
OL,10,Fserving a third of their sentence, as
OL,11,Fopposed to half, in a bid to ease
OL,12,Fprison overcrowding.
OL,14,FPrisoners serving longer sentences of
OL,15,Ffour years or more would be eligible
OL,16,Ffor release at the halfway point of
OL,17,Ftheir term, rather than at two-thirds
OL,18,Fas had previously been the case.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FThe changes were due to be phased in,
OL,8,Fbeginning with prisoners serving
OL,9,Fsentences of less than 575 days, going
OL,10,Fup to inmates jailed for 12 years or
OL,11,Fmore being eligible for early release
OL,12,Fin June next year.
OL,14,FThe government has said that, after
OL,15,Flistening to victims' concerns,
OL,16,Frapists and child sexual offenders
OL,17,Fwill not be eligible for the
OL,18,Fsentencing changes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FThese will be added to the exclusions
OL,8,Falready in place for 18,000 offenders,
OL,9,Fincluding those who have been found by
OL,10,Fa court to be the most dangerous or
OL,11,Fanyone serving a life sentence.
OL,13,FHowever, this does not appear to have
OL,14,Fruled out the killers of PC Harper,
OL,15,Fwho was 28 years old when he sustained
OL,16,Ffatal injuries while responding to a
OL,17,Fquad bike theft in Sulhamstead,
OL,18,FBerkshire, in August 2019.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FHe died after getting caught in a
OL,8,Fstrap attached to the back of a car
OL,9,Fand dragged down a country road as
OL,10,Fthree teenage suspects fled the scene
OL,11,Fof the burglary.
OL,13,FLast month the Ministry of Justice
OL,14,F(MoJ) confirmed that both men might be
OL,15,Feligible to be released from prison
OL,16,Fhalfway through their sentences `
OL,17,Figniting a national outcry and
OL,18,Fprompting the government to pause the
OL,19,Fearly release scheme.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FWidow Lissie Harper said: "This is
OL,8,Fdisgusting. I am beyond appalled and
OL,9,Fbristling with anger to hear that
OL,10,FAndrew's killers are soon to be free
OL,11,Fto roam the streets.
OL,13,F"What abhorrent message does this
OL,14,Fsend? How dare ministers say the
OL,15,Fkilling of a police officer is not
OL,16,Fenough of a 'sickening crime' that
OL,17,Fdeserves the stiffest of punishments.
OL,26,@oD@[OUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,F"The level of disrespect the
OL,8,FGovernment are showing to Andrew and
OL,9,Fother victims ` and to their loved
OL,10,Fones such as me ` is beyond contempt."
OL,12,FShe said releasing Andrew's killers
OL,13,Fearly would be "an affront to justice"
OL,14,Fand "an utter betrayal".
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@fO]uD@POUuD@fO]vD@EOUvD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FThe Victims' Commissioner for England
OL,8,Fand Wales, Claire Waxman, said that
OL,9,Fearly release plans have "been a
OL,10,Fsource of shock, distress and
OL,11,Funcertainty for victims" and that many
OL,12,Fhave been let down by "poor
OL,13,Fcommunication".
OL,15,FOn the new exclusions, she said:
OL,16,F"While this will be well received by
OL,17,Fsome victims, most will not fall
OL,18,Fwithin those categories, and
OL,19,Fexclusions alone cannot guarantee
OL,20,Fvictim or public safety.
OL,26,@qD@ZOUsD@XO]tD@WOUuD@NO]xD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30613
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,F"Effective risk management, meaningful
OL,8,Flicence conditions, proper supervision
OL,9,Fand timely, trauma-informed
OL,10,Fcommunication and support remain
OL,11,Fcritical."
OL,13,FThe government has also announced a
OL,14,Fnew package of victim support, backed
OL,15,Fby #10 million, to provide better
OL,16,Ftrauma-informed contact.
OL,18,FA new national helpline will also be
OL,19,Festablished and efforts made to
OL,20,Fcontact all affected victims to offer
OL,21,Finformation and support.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30614
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FBurnham added: "As a country, we
OL,8,Fhaven't invested in the prison estate
OL,9,Fwhen we should have, going back over a
OL,10,Fdecade. This has created an
OL,11,Funacceptable situation, with our adult
OL,12,Fmale prisons now at 98% capacity.
OL,14,F"For too long, the problems facing our
OL,15,Fprison system have been ignored ` and
OL,16,Fit's the victims who have been paying
OL,17,Fthe price. That is not good enough.
OL,26,@oD@POUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30615
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,F"My government will deliver the
OL,8,Ffastest prison building programme
OL,9,Fsince the Victorian era and do what's
OL,10,Fnecessary to fix the prison crisis."
OL,12,FLabour aims to have 14,000 new prison
OL,13,Fplaces by 2031.
OL,15,FBurnham has also asked Justice
OL,16,FSecretary Alex Norris to look at how
OL,17,Fthe UK can remove foreign offenders
OL,18,Ffaster and in greater numbers, review
OL,19,Foutdated Imprisonment for Public
OL,20,FProtection (IPP) sentences and free up
OL,21,Fspace in women's prisons.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30616
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FNorris said: "The prime minister and I
OL,8,Fhave reviewed these reforms, listened
OL,9,Fto the concerns and gone further to
OL,10,Fprotect victims.
OL,12,F"These are decisions no minister would
OL,13,Fever want to take, but it is right
OL,14,Fthese sickening crimes are excluded
OL,15,Ffrom these reforms.
OL,17,F"Victims will also have access to
OL,18,Fbetter support and reassurance that
OL,19,Foffenders leaving prison face tougher
OL,20,Fsupervision and punishment."
OL,26,@oD@NOUtD@AOUyD@AOU|D@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30617
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FWider releases under the Sentencing
OL,8,FAct have been delayed from September
OL,9,Fto October, giving probation staff
OL,10,Ftime to plan for releases and to
OL,11,Fensure victims can have a say in
OL,12,Frestrictions placed on offenders.
OL,14,FThe changes also introduce a new
OL,15,Fprogression model which will end
OL,16,Fautomatic release for badly behaved
OL,17,Foffenders. Those who break the rules
OL,18,For are violent behind bars face
OL,19,Fspending 100% of their sentence locked
OL,20,Fup.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30618
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FShadow justice secretary Nick Timothy
OL,13,Fsaid: "Labour whipped their MPs to
OL,14,Fvote to let rapists, paedophiles, and
OL,15,Fgrooming gang perpetrators out of
OL,16,Fprison early.
OL,18,F"Now they admit the Conservative
OL,19,Fcampaign to stop this was right ` this
OL,20,Fis a victory for victims.
OL,26,@uD@GOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30619
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785800898
OL,3,CBurnham blocks early prison release
OL,4,Cfor rapists and serious child sex
OL,5,Coffenders
OL,7,F"But their U-turn doesn't go far
OL,8,Fenough. Some child sex offenders and
OL,9,Fkillers, like those responsible for
OL,10,Fthe death of Pc Harper, will still be
OL,11,Freleased early. And the trauma of
OL,12,Fvictims being told their abusers may
OL,13,Fbe released can't be undone.
OL,15,F"One of Andy Burnham's first acts as
OL,16,Fprime minister will be to let
OL,17,Fthousands of criminals ` including
OL,18,Fkillers and paedophiles ` out early."
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOUzD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
